{
  "work": "The operator sells individual rides for the original trough-style Sommerrodelbahn Willingen. It is distinct from the neighbouring Ritz Racer alpine coaster opened in October 2026. The original track is described on its own operator page as a 250m lift and 700m descent with eleven bends and three jumps. The operator currently shows daily 09:00-18:00 but the old track normally runs only March-November, so no misleading year-round weekly rule was inserted. Single-ride prices were verified on 2 November 2026. Official editor searches for Sommerrodelbahn Willingen and Ritz Racer in Park and StandaloneAttraction returned no matches. Two exact Commons photos of the original track were visually checked and published, with source, author, license and eight-language alt text, captions and credit. No historic photo was attributed to the newly opened coaster. Eight locale URLs and two public image binaries returned HTTP 200 before Facebook publication.",
